  '**Total 25.** ⚠ **The profile to expect: A and B high, C split, D high.** **C fails where a learner names both faults and cannot price either**, ⚠ **which is the one piece of reasoning in the unit and is worth re-teaching with the two costs on the board.** **D is usually the best-answered writing task in Book 1, because all three sentences are formulas and the formulas work.**',
